#. module: product_route_mto
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_route_mto.field_product_product__is_mto
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Check or Uncheck this field to enable the Make To Order on the variant,\n"
"    independantly from its template configuration.\n"
"\n"
"    Please note that activating or deactivating Make To Order on the template,\n"
"    will reset this setting on its variants.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Označite to polje, da omogočite možnost 'Izdelava po naročilu' za "
"različico,\n"
"    neodvisno od konfiguracije predloge.\n"
"\n"
"    Upoštevajte, da bo aktiviranje ali deaktiviranje možnosti 'Izdelava po "
"naročilu' za predlogo,\n"
"    ponastavilo to nastavitev za njene različice.\n"

